<fw place="bottom" type="catch"><hi rendition="#u">unter-</hi></fw><lb/>
<pb facs="#f0052" n="44"/>
unter&#x017F;uchten nun <choice><sic>auch</sic><corr resp="#CT">auf</corr></choice> geringern Streken die<lb/>
