<hi rendition="#aq">Forster</hi></persName> Be&#x017F;chreibungen der Süd&#x017F;ee In&#x017F;eln,<note resp="#BF" type="editorial">Vgl. <bibl>Forster, Georg: A Voyage round the World: in His Britannic Majesty&#x2019;s Sloop, Resolution, commanded by Capt. James Cook, during the Years, 1772, 3, 4, and 5. 2 Bde. London 1777.</bibl> Online verfügbar: <ref target="http://digital.lb-oldenburg.de/urn/urn:nbn:de:gbv:45:1-1288">LB Oldenburg, abgerufen am 21.12.2015</ref>.</note> die An-<lb/>
